---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout title="Repository — Fathom" description="Technical breakdown of the Fathom GitHub repository: 12 Rust crates, 3 apps, CLI tools, and the internal architecture of autonomous AI workers.">
  <main class="repo-page">
    <PageHero cls="repo-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="repo.hero.badge">Repository</p>
      <h1 class="h2-sec" data-i18n-html data-i18n="repo.hero.title">The source, <em class="it">crate by crate.</em></h1>
      <p class="copy-lg mx-auto" data-i18n="repo.hero.sub">12 workspace crates, 3 apps, 50+ built-in tools, and a Rust CLI — everything in one public repository at <a href="https://github.com/yakushevhk/Fathom" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/yakushevhk/Fathom</a>.</p>
    </PageHero>
    <div class="container">

      <!-- Workspace -->
      <div class="sec-head" id="workspace">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__num">01</span><span data-i18n="repo.workspace.badge">Workspace</span></p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="repo.workspace.title">12 crates, one binary</h2>
        <p class="copy-lg" data-i18n="repo.workspace.sub">Cargo workspace with resolver 2. Each crate is a focused module — together they compile into a single <code>fathom</code> binary, plus optional apps.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="crate-grid">
        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-core</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/core</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Shared types, config, error handling, event bus (<code>IrcBus</code>), session management, tool trait, token accounting, async jobs, daemon registry, and capability definitions. Foundation every other crate depends on.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">config</span><span class="crate-mod">session</span><span class="crate-mod">agent</span><span class="crate-mod">tool</span><span class="crate-mod">event</span><span class="crate-mod">finding</span><span class="crate-mod">profile</span><span class="crate-mod">token</span><span class="crate-mod">irc</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-llm</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/llm</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Streaming LLM provider abstraction. Provider factory (DeepSeek, OpenAI-compatible), concurrency-limited dispatch, retry with backoff, token-aware response streaming.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">provider</span><span class="crate-mod">deepseek</span><span class="crate-mod">concurrency</span><span class="crate-mod">retry</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-agent</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/agent</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Agent runtime: hierarchical agent loop, coordinator with fan-out, budget tracking, context compaction, doom-loop detection, process manager, task tree, goal mode with reflection, lifecycle hooks, and crash recovery.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">coordinator</span><span class="crate-mod">runtime</span><span class="crate-mod">compaction</span><span class="crate-mod">hooks</span><span class="crate-mod">reflection</span><span class="crate-mod">resume</span><span class="crate-mod">ipc</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-tools</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/tools</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">50+ built-in tools: web search/fetch/crawl, file I/O, shell, Python/Node REPL, Git, PDF, LSP, browser CDP, computer use, OSINT extraction, email/social verification, CRM sync, memory, hub coordination, and spawn agent.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">search</span><span class="crate-mod">web</span><span class="crate-mod">crawl</span><span class="crate-mod">extract</span><span class="crate-mod">verify_email</span><span class="crate-mod">browser</span><span class="crate-mod">computer</span><span class="crate-mod">git</span><span class="crate-mod">hub</span><span class="crate-mod">spawn</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-mcp</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/mcp</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Model Context Protocol client and server. Client connects to external MCP servers over stdio or HTTP, discovers tools dynamically. Server exposes Fathom's tool registry to any MCP-compatible host.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">client</span><span class="crate-mod">server</span><span class="crate-mod">bridge</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-persistence</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/persistence</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">SQLite/PostgreSQL persistence layer: sessions, agents, messages, findings, contacts, credentials, coworkers, channels, schedules, jobs, replay logs, and file history.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">contacts</span><span class="crate-mod">jobs</span><span class="crate-mod">coworkers</span><span class="crate-mod">schedules</span><span class="crate-mod">credentials</span><span class="crate-mod">replay</span><span class="crate-mod">pg</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-memory</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/memory</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Semantic memory: append-only knowledge base with hybrid vector + BM25 search, entity graph, secret scanning, 5-outcome absorb pipeline, distillation, and automatic garbage collection.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">absorb</span><span class="crate-mod">search</span><span class="crate-mod">graph</span><span class="crate-mod">embed</span><span class="crate-mod">distill</span><span class="crate-mod">gc</span><span class="crate-mod">secrets</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-server</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/server</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Axum HTTP server: REST API for sessions, agents, jobs, memory, governance, credentials, coworkers, schedules, computer relay, and SSE event streaming. Prometheus metrics and AG-UI compatibility.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">auth</span><span class="crate-mod">agui</span><span class="crate-mod">metrics</span><span class="crate-mod">jobs_api</span><span class="crate-mod">memory_api</span><span class="crate-mod">governance_api</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-tui</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/tui</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Ratatui-based terminal interface: live agent tree, streaming output, event log, memory and jobs panels, approval flow, session replay, and mid-run steering.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">app</span><span class="crate-mod">ui</span><span class="crate-mod">event</span><span class="crate-mod">streaming</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-lsp</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/lsp</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Language Server Protocol integration. Auto-detects language servers (rust-analyzer, pyright, typescript-language-server), manages installations, and exposes code intelligence tools.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">client</span><span class="crate-mod">detect</span><span class="crate-mod">install</span><span class="crate-mod">tool</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-governance</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/governance</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Policy engine: capability-based governance, approval gates, tool allow/deny lists, supervisor integration, and session-bound policy enforcement.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">lib</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="crate-card">
          <div class="crate-head">
            <span class="crate-name">pr-supervisor</span>
            <span class="crate-path">crates/supervisor</span>
          </div>
          <p class="crate-desc">Supervisor runtime: lifecycle management, cross-session coordination, daemon oversight, and top-level process supervision.</p>
          <div class="crate-mods">
            <span class="crate-mod">lib</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Architecture diagram -->
      <div class="sec-head" id="layers">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__num">02</span><span data-i18n="repo.layers.badge">Layers</span></p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="repo.layers.title">How the crates connect</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="layer-diagram">
        <div class="layer-row">
          <div class="layer-label">CLI</div>
          <div class="layer-boxes">
            <span class="layer-box layer-box--cli">fathom binary</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="layer-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="layer-row">
          <div class="layer-label">Interfaces</div>
          <div class="layer-boxes">
            <span class="layer-box">pr-server</span>
            <span class="layer-box">pr-tui</span>
            <span class="layer-box">pr-mcp</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="layer-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="layer-row">
          <div class="layer-label">Orchestration</div>
          <div class="layer-boxes">
            <span class="layer-box">pr-agent</span>
            <span class="layer-box">pr-tools</span>
            <span class="layer-box">pr-lsp</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="layer-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="layer-row">
          <div class="layer-label">Persistence</div>
          <div class="layer-boxes">
            <span class="layer-box">pr-persistence</span>
            <span class="layer-box">pr-memory</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="layer-arrow">↓</div>
        <div class="layer-row">
          <div class="layer-label">Foundation</div>
          <div class="layer-boxes">
            <span class="layer-box">pr-core</span>
            <span class="layer-box">pr-llm</span>
            <span class="layer-box">pr-governance</span>
            <span class="layer-box">pr-supervisor</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Apps -->
      <div class="sec-head" id="apps">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__num">03</span><span data-i18n="repo.apps.badge">Apps</span></p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="repo.apps.title">Three companion apps</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="apps-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <div class="app-name">apps/computer</div>
          <p class="app-desc">Playwright-based browser automation relay. Runs as a sidecar service, exposes a CDP-like API for the <code>browser_*</code> and <code>computer_*</code> tools. Docker image available.</p>
          <div class="app-stack">
            <span class="app-tech">TypeScript</span><span class="app-tech">Playwright</span><span class="app-tech">Node.js</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <div class="app-name">apps/desktop</div>
          <p class="app-desc">Tauri v2 desktop wrapper. Bundles the web dashboard into a native window with system tray, notifications, and auto-launch. Built with React + TypeScript.</p>
          <div class="app-stack">
            <span class="app-tech">Tauri v2</span><span class="app-tech">React</span><span class="app-tech">Rust</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <div class="app-name">apps/web</div>
          <p class="app-desc">Next.js 16 dashboard. Session monitoring, agent tree, memory stats, jobs management, live events, governance console, and coworker management. Talks to the server API.</p>
          <div class="app-stack">
            <span class="app-tech">Next.js 16</span><span class="app-tech">React</span><span class="app-tech">TypeScript</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Website -->
      <div class="sec-head" id="website">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__num">04</span><span data-i18n="repo.website.badge">Website</span></p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="repo.website.title">This site</h2>
        <p class="copy-lg" data-i18n="repo.website.sub">47 pages across two builds: the marketing site (Astro 7, 30+ pages, i18n en/ru, Three.js visualizations) and technical documentation (MDX content collection). Deployed at <a href="https://fathom.uz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">fathom.uz</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="website-grid">
        <div class="ws-card">
          <div class="ws-name">website/</div>
          <p class="ws-desc">Astro 7 marketing site. Pages, components, i18n translations, Three.js scenes (orb, ocean, hero field), blog posts, agent pages, docs layout.</p>
          <div class="ws-stack">
            <span class="tech">Astro 7</span><span class="tech">MDX</span><span class="tech">Three.js</span><span class="tech">i18n</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ws-card">
          <div class="ws-name">whitepaper/</div>
          <p class="ws-desc">Technical whitepaper and slide deck: architecture, agent runtime, tools, multi-agent, orchestration, business model, benchmarks. HTML slides with custom CSS.</p>
          <div class="ws-stack">
            <span class="tech">HTML</span><span class="tech">CSS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ws-card">
          <div class="ws-name">docs/</div>
          <p class="ws-desc">Crate-level documentation: architecture decisions, API reference, configuration, deployment guides, OSINT pipeline, troubleshooting, and memory system docs.</p>
          <div class="ws-stack">
            <span class="tech">Markdown</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tech stack -->
      <div class="sec-head" id="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__num">05</span><span data-i18n="repo.stack.badge">Stack</span></p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="repo.stack.title">Dependencies &amp; runtime</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="stack-grid">
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">Language</div>
          <div class="stack-items">Rust 2021 edition · MSRV 1.97</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">Async</div>
          <div class="stack-items">tokio (full) · tokio-util · futures</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">HTTP</div>
          <div class="stack-items">reqwest (rustls) · axum · SSE</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">CLI</div>
          <div class="stack-items">clap (derive) · ratatui · crossterm</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">Database</div>
          <div class="stack-items">rusqlite (WAL) · tokio-postgres · deadpool</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">Serialization</div>
          <div class="stack-items">serde · serde_json · toml · schemars</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">LLM</div>
          <div class="stack-items">OpenAI-compatible · DeepSeek · streaming · tiktoken-rs</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">Parsing</div>
          <div class="stack-items">scraper · quick-xml · lopdf · phonenumber</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">Protocols</div>
          <div class="stack-items">MCP client/server · LSP · SSE · CDP</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-card">
          <div class="stack-cat">License</div>
          <div class="stack-items">Elastic License 2.0</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="cta-strip">
        <div class="cta-copy">
          <h3 data-i18n="repo.cta.title">Browse the full source</h3>
          <p data-i18n="repo.cta.sub">Every crate, every tool, every test — open in one repository.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="https://github.com/yakushevhk/Fathom" class="cta-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="repo.cta.github">View on GitHub →</a>
          <a href="/docs" class="cta-link" data-i18n="repo.cta.docs">Documentation</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .repo-page { padding: 70px 0 90px; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grey-600); }
  .h3-sec { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 34px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 12px 0 16px; }
  .copy-lg { color: var(--grey-700); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 640px; }
  .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  .repo-hero { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 48px; text-align: center; padding: 0 24px; }
  .repo-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 68px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; margin-top: 12px; }
  .repo-hero .copy-lg { margin-top: 20px; }
  .repo-hero a { color: var(--grey-800); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .repo-hero a:hover { color: var(--grey-900); }

  .sec-head { max-width: 720px; margin: 56px 0 24px; }

  /* Crate grid */
  .crate-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--grey-300); border: 1px solid var(--grey-300); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  .crate-card { background: var(--bg-primary); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transition: background .25s var(--ease-out); }
  .crate-card:hover { background: var(--bg-card-hover); }
  .crate-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
  .crate-name { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: var(--grey-900); }
  .crate-path { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--grey-500); white-space: nowrap; }
  .crate-desc { color: var(--grey-600); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .crate-mods { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-top: auto; }
  .crate-mod { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--grey-700); background: var(--grey-100); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .crate-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .crate-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* Layer diagram */
  .layer-diagram { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .layer-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
  .layer-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; color: var(--grey-500); text-align: right; }
  .layer-boxes { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .layer-box { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--grey-800); background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--grey-300); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 8px 14px; transition: border-color .2s; }
  .layer-box:hover { border-color: var(--grey-500); }
  .layer-box--cli { background: var(--grey-900); color: var(--on-accent); border-color: var(--grey-900); }
  .layer-arrow { text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--grey-400); padding: 4px 0; }

  /* Apps grid */
  .apps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--grey-300); border: 1px solid var(--grey-300); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  .app-card { background: var(--bg-primary); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transition: background .25s var(--ease-out); }
  .app-card:hover { background: var(--bg-card-hover); }
  .app-name { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .app-desc { color: var(--grey-600); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .app-stack { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-top: auto; }
  .app-tech { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--grey-700); background: var(--grey-100); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .apps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* Website grid */
  .website-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--grey-300); border: 1px solid var(--grey-300); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  .ws-card { background: var(--bg-primary); padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; transition: background .25s var(--ease-out); }
  .ws-card:hover { background: var(--bg-card-hover); }
  .ws-name { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .ws-desc { color: var(--grey-600); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .ws-stack { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-top: auto; }
  .ws-stack .tech { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--grey-700); background: var(--grey-100); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .website-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* Stack grid */
  .stack-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--grey-300); border: 1px solid var(--grey-300); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  .stack-card { background: var(--bg-primary); padding: 20px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; transition: background .25s var(--ease-out); }
  .stack-card:hover { background: var(--bg-card-hover); }
  .stack-cat { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; color: var(--grey-500); }
  .stack-items { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--grey-800); line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .stack-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-strip { margin-top: 64px; background: var(--bg-dark); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 40px 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; }
  .cta-copy h3 { color: #fff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
